; Desktop Subsystem for Android (DSA)
; The patched framework (make-image.py --framework): after a GPU device loss SurfaceFlinger
; counts the reset in debug.dsa.gpu.resets, which the apps' renderers wait on, because their
; devices went with the same GPU. Every domain may read debug properties, and SurfaceFlinger
; already reaches the property service; it may now set this label too.
(allow surfaceflinger debug_prop (property_service (set)))
